  "referenceNumber": "RUS0192",
  "remarks": "\nThe ownership of the Massandra Winery, a business trading in Crimea, was transferred contrary to the Ukrainian law. The enterprise was confiscated by the Crimean ‘authorities’. The subsequent ‘sale’ of the entity to the Yuzhny Proyect Company (Southern Project Company), affiliated with the Rossiya Bank which was founded by Yury Kovalchuk, was therefore a further unlawful transfer. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
